# Generic agent indexing exclusions.
# Not every agent recognizes this file; AGENTS.md repeats the critical rules.

# Build and dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/target/
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/playwright-color-report/
**/test-results/

# Generated evidence and large source assets
reference-assets/images/
reference-assets/spa/
reference-assets/evidence/**/rendered.html
**/docs/evidence/generated/*.json

# Human-only onboarding
docs/human/

# IDE and archives
.vscode/
.idea/
*.zip
*.7z

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!*.env.example
